### 상품 추가
POST localhost:8080/cart/add/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 10,
  "quantity" : 10
}

### 상품 수량 조정
PATCH localhost:8080/cart/adjust/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 10,
  "quantity" : 9
}

### 장바구니 조회
GET localhost:8080/cart/1

### 상품 삭제
DELETE localhost:8080/cart/delete/1/10

### 장바구니 비우기
DELETE localhost:8080/cart/clear/1